   "candidate_id": "us-house-fl27-salazar",
   "url": "https://salazar.house.gov/media/press-releases/problem-solvers-caucus-endorses-dignity-act",
   "kind": "press_release",
   "title": "Problem Solvers Caucus Endorses the Dignity Act | Representative Maria Salazar",
   "text": "Organizations (50+): Agriculture Workforce Coalition, Alliance for a New Immigration Consensus (ANIC), American Action Forum, American Business Immigration Coalition, American Families United, American Immigration Lawyers Association, American Podiatric Medical Association, American Senior Housing Association, Americans for Prosperity, BDV Solutions, Behring Co., Bipartisan Policy Center, Brick Industry Association, Business Roundtable, Catholic Charities USA, Casa de Venezuela, Chris Coons, U.S."
  },
  {
