   "title": "GIMENEZ SECURES $23.7 MILLION FOR SOUTH FLORIDA | Press Releases | Congressman Carlos Gimenez",
   "text": "“Body cameras are an incredibly important component of public safety, both for the men and women in uniform and for citizens engaging with the police. These body cameras will help provide transparency, and if needed, accountability, to ensure best practices are being met by our brave law enforcement officials,” Gimenez said."
  },
