   "title": "GIMENEZ SECURES $23.7 MILLION FOR SOUTH FLORIDA | Press Releases | Congressman Carlos Gimenez",
   "text": "“This funding will help expand employment opportunities and vocational trainings for some of the most underserved communities throughout Miami-Dade County. During my time as Mayor of Miami-Dade County, I was dedicated to the upward mobility of our families. In Congress, I am honored to keep fighting to make sure economic opportunities and roads to prosperity are made open and available for all of our working families,” Gimenez said."
