   "text": "Díaz-Balart Secures $11.6M for Everglades Restoration, including $4M additional for Southern Florida Priorities, and Codification of Section 404 Permitting in FY 2027 Interior Funding Bill | Congressman Mario Diaz-Balart Díaz-Balart Secures $11.6M for Everglades Restoration, including $4M additional for Southern Florida Priorities, and Codification of Section 404 Permitting in FY 2027 Interior Funding Bill"
