   "text": "Scott Singer is an America First mayor who has delivered on President Trump’s agenda as chairman of the America First Policy Institute’s Mayors’ Council. Scott Singer will aggressively target the waste, fraud, and abuse exposed by the Trump administration. He supports prosecuting those who defraud taxpayers and banning members of Congress from trading stocks. As the three-term mayor of Boca Raton, Scott Singer cut taxes 7 times. In Congress, he will champion lower taxes for hardworking Americans so they can keep more of what they earn. Scott Singer will work with President Trump to deport violent and dangerous illegal immigrants."
