   "kind": "official_issues",
   "title": "Foreign Affairs | Congressman Mario Diaz-Balart",
   "text": "Foreign Affairs | Congressman Mario Diaz-Balart Congressman Diaz-Balart Remembers the Victims of the October 7 Terrorist Attacks WASHINGTON, D.C. – Congressman Mario Díaz-Balart (FL-26), Dean of the Florida Delegation, Vice Chair of the House Committee on Appropriations and Chairman of the Subcommittee on National Security, Department of State, and Related Programs, released the following statement remembering the victims of the October 7 terrorist attacks: No More Blank Checks: Appropriators, White House Direct UN Accountability WASHINGTON, D.C. – From Congress to the White House, the Republican agenda has been clear: disrupting the broken status quo."
  },
