   "kind": "official_issues",
   "title": "Foreign Affairs | Congressman Mario Diaz-Balart",
   "text": "“Socialism and the government takeover of our lives have no place in America. It is anathema to our way of life and the American Dream. Congressional Taiwan Caucus Co-Chairs Urge Lithuanian Leaders to Continue Bold Support for Taiwan in Joint Letter"
  },
  {
   "id": 675,
   "candidate_id": "us-house-fl26-diaz-balart",
   "url": "https://mariodiazbalart.house.gov/issues/foreign-affairs",
   "kind": "official_issues",
   "title": "Foreign Affairs | Congressman Mario Diaz-Balart",
   "text": "WASHINGTON, D.C. - Today, Representatives Mario Diaz-Balart (R-FL), Ami Bera (D-CA), Andy Barr (R-KY), and Greg Stanton (D-AZ), Co-Chairs of the Congressional Taiwan Caucus sent a joint letter to the Honorable Mindaugas Sinkevičius, Prime Minister of Lithuania; Honorable Gitanas Nausėda, President of Lithuania; Honorable Juozas Olekas, Speaker of the Seimas; Honorable Kęstutis Budrys, Foreign Minister; and Honorable Robertas Kaunas, Defense Minister, requesting that Lithuania continues its courageous path of maintaining relations with Taiwan. Congresista Mario Diaz-Balart asiste a la inauguración Presidencial de su Excelencia Abelardo de la Espriella"
  },
  {
