   "kind": "campaign_news",
   "title": "Voter Information - Vote Phil Ehr",
   "text": "Check Your Voter Information & Important Dates Florida law now requires that voters renew their vote-by-mail requests every 2 years. You MUST re-enroll to vote-by-mail on November 3, 2026. Get information about early voting sites, schedule, and secure ballot intake locations. Use your address to find your Election Day polling location along with pertinent precinct details and statistics. General Election: Tuesday, November 3, 2026 Deadline to send vote-by-mail ballots to UOCAVA voters: September 19, 2026 Deadline to send vote-by-mail ballots to domestic voters: September 24 2026 – October 1, 2026 Deadline to register to vote:  October 5, 2026"
  },
  {
   "id": 1062,
   "candidate_id": "us-house-fl28-ehr",
   "url": "https://ehrforcongress.us/voter-information/",
   "kind": "campaign_news",
   "title": "Voter Information - Vote Phil Ehr",
   "text": "Deadline to request vote-by-mail ballot: October 22, 2026 Miami-Dade: October 19 – November 1, 2026 Election Day:  November 3, 2026 (You must vote at your assigned polling place on Election Day)"
  },
  {
   "id": 1063,
   "candidate_id": "us-house-fl28-rojas",
   "url": "https://www.eddyrojas.com/about",
   "kind": "campaign_home",
   "title": "About | ROJAS FOR CONGRESS",
   "text": "Eddy Rojas came to Miami from Cuba with a dream and a work ethic that wouldn't quit. Over the past 20 years, he built a successful service company from the ground up — going from parking cars to leading one of Florida's most respected service businesses. He knows what it means to work hard, raise a family, and fight for the American Dream. Now, Eddy is running for Congress to bring that same dedication and honesty to Washington — because Miami's hardworking families deserve a representative who truly understands their struggles. \"My family is my anchor. Everything I do is for their future — and for every family in District 28.\""
  },
  {
   "id": 1064,
   "candidate_id": "us-house-fl28-rojas",
   "url": "https://www.eddyrojas.com/events-1",
   "kind": "campaign_issues",
   "title": "Events | ROJAS FOR CONGRESS",
   "text": "I'll fight to cut burdensome regulations, lower taxes on small businesses, and bring good-paying jobs back to Miami. As a business owner, I know what it takes to create opportunity — and I'll bring that experience to Congress. Education is the key to the American Dream. I will fight for school choice, vocational training, and affordable higher education so every child in District 28 has the chance to succeed — no matter their zip code. Every family deserves to feel safe in their neighborhood. I will support our law enforcement, secure our borders, and invest in community programs that prevent crime and give our youth a brighter future."
  },
  {
   "id": 1065,
   "candidate_id": "us-house-fl28-rojas",
   "url": "https://www.eddyrojas.com/events-1",
   "kind": "campaign_issues",
   "title": "Events | ROJAS FOR CONGRESS",
   "text": "Healthcare should be affordable and accessible for every family. I'll work across the aisle to lower prescription drug costs, expand telehealth, and protect Medicare for our seniors. Eddy in the community — listening, learning, leading."
  },
