   "text": "The Latest - Angie Nixon for U.S. Senate U.S. Senate Candidate Angie Nixon Blasts Sen. Ashley Moody After Court Expunges Bombshell Hope Florida Grand Jury Report MIAMI, FL – Following a state appellate court’s decision to expunge a grand jury report that found $10 million in Medicaid settlement funds had been misappropriated to the Hope Florida Foundation, U.S. Senate candidate Angie Nixon released the following statement:... U.S. Senate Candidate Angie Nixon Blasts Cruel Medicaid Cuts Kicking Nearly 177,000 Legal Immigrant Floridians Off Healthcare"
  },
  {
