   "kind": "campaign_home",
   "title": "Neil J. Gillespie for U.S. Senate",
   "text": "I believe my Notice to The Florida Bar: Anti-Weaponization Fund Federal Lawsuit , substantiates my Complaint of Election Fraud in the 2020 Election of Joe Biden and Kamala Harris (based on the Rule of Law , Separation of Powers Doctrine of Checks and Balances ) filed with the Federal Election Commission , and the Supreme Court of the United States ( PDF ), with Notice to President Trump ( PDF ), is of special interest to We The People , my campaign for United States Senate , and my campaign Neil2028 ( currently paused )."
