   "candidate_id": "us-senate-fl-gillespie",
   "url": "https://neilgillespie4senate.blogspot.com/",
   "kind": "campaign_home",
   "title": "Neil J. Gillespie for U.S. Senate",
   "text": "The United States Library of Congress has selected your website for inclusion in the United States Election 2026 Web Archive, which is part of a larger collection of historically and culturally significant websites that have been designated for preservation. The following URL has been selected: https://neilgillespie4senate.blogspot.com/."
