   "candidate_id": "us-senate-fl-gillespie",
   "url": "https://neilgillespie4senate.blogspot.com/",
   "kind": "campaign_home",
   "title": "Neil J. Gillespie for U.S. Senate",
   "text": "The Florida Bar has opened a disciplinary file on President Donald Trump’s attorney Alejandro Brito after the federal judge overseeing the president's suit against the Internal Revenue Service referred him for discipline, the bar's communications director confirmed to Law.com Thursday. \" We can confirm that a file has been opened ,\" Communications Director Jennifer Krell Davis wrote in a Thursday email."
