   "text": "Neil J. Gillespie for U.S. Senate : Notice to The Florida Bar: Anti-Weaponization Fund Federal Lawsuit Notice to The Florida Bar: Anti-Weaponization Fund Federal Lawsuit Notice to The Florida Bar: Anti-Weaponization Fund Federal Lawsuit Mr. Joshua E. Doyle, Executive Director , The Florida Bar Cc: Mr. Richard Courtemanche, Deputy General Counsel, The Florida Bar It has come to my attention that Judge Kathleen Williams may have referred Florida attorney Alejandro Brito, Bar # 98442, to the Florida Bar for consideration on whether Brito should be disciplined in light of the findings in the new order in Trump v IRS , according to a post by David Oscar Markus on his SDFLA blog"
