   "text": "AP: Impeachment sought against federal judge over alleged sex in chambers, lying to investigators Reason: The Stains On The Federal Judiciary TMZ: Judge Busted For Sex In Chambers ID'd As Obama Pick Who Sentenced Todd Chrisley Click image, Gregory W. Kehoe, U.S. Attorney MDFL, Re Homicide of Sarah Thompson, Ocala Florida Death of Sarah Thompson, age 35, May 12, 2021, Ocala, Florida NEIL J GILLESPIE v GOOGLE ET AL Google Lawsuit Florida Bar Complaint WANTED: Jamie Dimon CEO JPMorgan Chase & Co TransUnion consumer dispute NetCredit and Republic Bank TRIAL LAWYER$ AND RICK $COTT TAKE YOUR HEALTHCARE $$$ Rick Scott and the fraud case of Columbia/HCA"
